# yosys/lhd logs, several GB per sweep. Kept ON DISK as the evidence trail --
# the CONCLUSIONS belong in pass/lean/GATED_MODULES.tsv and
# pass/lean/DIRECTION2_RESULTS.md, which are tracked.
generated/provenance/

